  "definition": "Quality Management",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-02-16",
  "historyNote": "#9476, eff 5-22-09 (from He-A 304.17); ss by #12178, INTERIM, eff 5-20-17, EXPIRES: 11-16-17 New. #12476, eff 2-16-18",
